{\*\ftnsep\chftnsep}\pgndec\pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
One. The measurement of a line changes when one word inside it is }{\loch\cs15\loch\b\loch
emboldened}{\loch
 and the rest is not, because a bold face is wider than the regular one it replaces.}
\par \pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
Two. A run set larger than the paragraph makes its own line taller: }{\loch\cs17\loch\fs44\loch
twentytwo}{\loch
 raises this line and leaves the following lines alone, so the pitch between them is not constant down the paragraph and every line after it moves.}
\par \pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
Three. A run set smaller than the paragraph does not shrink the line, because the line keeps the tallest run it holds: }{\loch\cs18\loch\fs16\loch
eightpoint}{\loch
 sits inside a line whose height the eleven point text around it still decides.}
\par \pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
Four. A }{\loch\cs16\loch\i\loch
phrase set in italics that is long enough to run past the end of the line it starts on and continue onto the next one}{\loch
 becomes two drawn runs rather than one, because a glyph run is one face at one position and a line break is a position.}
\par \pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
Five. A }{\loch\cs19\hich\af4\loch\f4\loch
serif face with different metrics}{\loch
 mixed into a sans paragraph decides the line's ascent and descent separately from its height.}
\par \pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
Six. A }{\loch\cs20\loch\cf17\loch
coloured run}{\loch
 measures exactly as the text around it and draws differently, which is why colour travels with the drawing half of a run rather than the measuring half.}
\par \pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
Seven. Nesting: }{\loch\cs21\loch\fs48\loch
a run at twice the default size containing }{\loch\cs15\loch\b\loch
a bold word}{\loch\cs21\loch\fs48\loch
 that inherits the size}{\loch
 and then back to the paragraph's own.}
\par \pard\plain \s27\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang2057\langfe2052\hich\af5\loch\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\hyphpar0\ltrpar\f5\fs22\lang2057\cf0\kerning1\dbch\af7\langfe2052\sl240\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\fi0\sb0\sa113\ltrpar{\loch
Eight. A paragraph with no runs at all measures on the single face path, which is the common case and must keep working: kerning across the whole paragraph rather than restarting at every run boundary is what keeps this line where Writer puts it.}
\par }